  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/65MY\r\n\r\nWhether you're a savvy investor, a growing family or someone who loves having options, this property is well worth a closer look! Set on a generous 880sqm freehold section, this legal home-and-income property offers two separate dwellings, rental income potential and exciting possibilities for the future.\r\n\r\nThe main home offers the convenience of almost single-level living, with a practical layout that makes everyday life easy. The spacious open-plan lounge and dining area opens directly onto a flat lawn - perfect for the kids to run around, weekend BBQs with friends or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe well-equipped original kitchen keeps meal preparation simple, while three good-sized double bedrooms and a family bathroom provide comfortable accommodation. There's also a separate laundry for added convenience.\r\n\r\nHere's where things get interesting! The self-contained, legal one-bedroom unit features its own open-plan lounge and dining area, a balcony for relaxing, plus a generous double bedroom and bathroom. Rent it out to help with the mortgage, give grandparents or adult children their own space, or keep it handy for visiting family and friends. It's a flexible setup with plenty of possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe large standalone double garage comes with extra workshop space, making it ideal for DIY projects, hobbies or tinkering with your latest pride and joy. Add a carport and plenty of off-street parking, and there's room for extra vehicles, too. Your dream workshop or ultimate man cave could be waiting!\r\n\r\nMore than just two dwellings, this property offers a generous 880sqm freehold site with potential to investigate future subdivision, subject to Council approval. With sewage connected on site and a stormwater connection just outside the property, it's an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nWith a bus stop right at your doorstep, getting around is easy. The property is zoned for Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Long Bay Beach and Regional Park are just a short drive away, while Albany's Westfield shopping mall, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, entertainment and motorway access are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWith the vendors' decision made, this property is going to be sold!  Don't miss your chance to secure this versatile property with so much on offer. Get in touch today to arrange a viewing and discover the possibilities for yourself!\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
